<Base title="Privacy Policy — Trypup" description="How Trypup handles data. The app works without an account; an optional account enables cloud backup of your progress (Firebase, EU)." lang="en" alt="/zasady-ochrany/">
  <section class="section wrap prose">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="meta">Updated 27 Jun 2026 · Controller: OndysLab s.r.o., <a href="mailto:hello@trypup.life">hello@trypup.life</a></p>

    <p><strong>Trypup works fully without an account — in that case all data stays on your device only.</strong> Optionally you can create an account, which enables <strong>cloud backup of your saved progress</strong> and syncing across devices. We process only the data necessary to provide the service.</p>

    <OperatorBlock lang="en" heading="Data controller" />

    <h2>What data we process</h2>
    <h3>Always (locally on your device)</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Location (GPS)</strong> — measuring walk route and distance + anti-cheat. Processed ephemerally, does not leave the device. Optional.</li>
      <li><strong>Motion sensors</strong> — verifying the walk is real. Local, not persisted.</li>
      <li><strong>Notifications</strong> — locally scheduled care reminders. Optional.</li>
      <li><strong>Photos / camera</strong> — optional dog photo. Local only.</li>
      <li><strong>Apple Health / Google Fit</strong> — optional write of a completed walk. We only write, we don't read.</li>
      <li><strong>Game state</strong> (dog name, breed, stats, progress) — local storage.</li>
      <li><strong>In-app analytics</strong> — optional, measured <strong>on-device only</strong> and requires your consent; we don't send app data to a server. It is <strong>fully disabled</strong> for users under 16 (see "Children and minors"). <em>(This website trypup.life separately uses Google Analytics — see "Cookies and website analytics" below.)</em></li>
    </ul>
    <h3>Only if you create an account</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Email address</strong> — for sign-in and account management.</li>
      <li><strong>User identifier</strong> (account ID) — a technical identifier assigned by the authentication provider.</li>
      <li><strong>Saved-progress backup</strong> (dog, training, daily progress, purchased features) — stored in the cloud so it can be restored on another device.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Your password is stored only in secure (hashed) form by the authentication provider; we have no access to it.</p>

    <h2>Purposes and legal basis (GDPR Art. 6)</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Account and cloud backup</strong> — performance of a contract (Art. 6(1)(b)).</li>
      <li><strong>Walk measurement (GPS)</strong> — a feature you explicitly request (Art. 6(1)(b)); processing is local.</li>
      <li><strong>On-device analytics</strong> — your consent (Art. 6(1)(a)), which you can withdraw at any time.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Processors and data location</h2>
    <p>For the account and cloud backup we use <strong>Google (Firebase — Authentication and Firestore)</strong> as a processor, under the <em>Firebase Data Processing and Security Terms</em>. The backup (Firestore) is stored in <strong>EU data centers (region europe / eur3)</strong>. The Authentication service may process part of the data outside the EU; such transfers are covered by <strong>Standard Contractual Clauses (SCCs)</strong> approved by the European Commission.</p>

    <h2>Data sharing</h2>
    <p>We do <strong>not</strong> sell or share your data with third parties for their own purposes. Google acts as our processor (on our instructions), not as an independent recipient. Shelters listed in the app are just links to public websites.</p>

    <h2>Cookies and website analytics (trypup.life)</h2>
    <p>This website uses <strong>Google Analytics 4</strong> (Google Ireland Ltd.) to anonymously measure traffic so we can improve the site. Analytics cookies and measurement only start <strong>after you give consent</strong> in the cookie bar (legal basis: consent, Art. 6(1)(a)). Until you consent, Google Analytics runs in a <strong>cookieless</strong> mode (Google Consent Mode). Google acts as a processor and may process part of the data <strong>outside the EU</strong>, covered by <strong>Standard Contractual Clauses (SCCs)</strong>. You can <strong>change or withdraw consent at any time</strong> via the <strong>"Cookies"</strong> link in the site footer. This website analytics is separate from the (optional) in-app analytics, which stays on your device.</p>

    <p>The specific cookies and storage this website uses:</p>
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Duration</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><code>_ga</code></td><td>Google Analytics — distinguishes visitors for anonymous statistics. Set <strong>only after you consent</strong>.</td><td>2 years</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>_ga_8MWP5X5RPR</code></td><td>Google Analytics — persists session state. Set <strong>only after you consent</strong>.</td><td>2 years</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>trypup-consent</code><br><small>(localStorage)</small></td><td>Remembers your analytics consent choice. Strictly necessary for the consent bar; nothing else is stored without consent.</td><td>Until you clear browser data</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>Retention</h2>
    <p>Local data stays on your device until you delete the app or reset it. We keep the cloud backup for the lifetime of your account; once you <strong>delete your account</strong>, we remove it.</p>

    <h2>Your rights (GDPR)</h2>
    <p>You have the right to access, rectification, erasure, restriction, portability and objection. <strong>You can delete your account and cloud backup directly in the app</strong> (Account → Delete account). If you have uninstalled the app, email <a href="mailto:hello@trypup.life">hello@trypup.life</a> and we will delete your data. You can withdraw analytics consent anytime in settings.</p>
    <p>You also have the right to lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority — in the Czech Republic the <strong>Office for Personal Data Protection (ÚOOÚ)</strong>, <a href="https://uoou.gov.cz" target="_blank" rel="noopener">uoou.gov.cz</a>.</p>

    <h2>Children and minors</h2>
    <p>On first launch the app asks for the user's age category ("16 or older" / "under 16"). <strong>The answer stays on your device only and is never sent anywhere.</strong></p>
    <p>For users <strong>under 16</strong>, analytics collection is <strong>completely disabled</strong> — regardless of the in-app consent setting — and <strong>purchase options are not shown</strong>. The 16-year threshold matches the strictest age of consent under the GDPR (Art. 8). We do not knowingly collect any personal data from children. If you believe a child under 16 has provided us with personal data, contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@trypup.life">hello@trypup.life</a> and we will delete it.</p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>We will announce material changes in the app and here. When we add social sign-in (Apple/Google) we will list those providers as processors.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
